LARES PAYMENT OF QUARTERLY DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS', 'text': 'LOUISVILLE, KY.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HUMANA INC. (NYSE: HUM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND TO STOCKHOLDERS OF $0.885 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON JULY 28, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 30, 2023. ABOUT HUMANA HUMANA INC. (NYSE: HUM) IS COMMITTED TO HELPING OUR MILLIONS OF MEDICAL AND SPECIALTY MEMBERS ACHIEVE THEIR BEST HEALTH.'}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2023-04-20 16:30:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDENDS ON ITS COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCKS', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , APRIL 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK (NASDAQ: HBAN) OF $0.155 PER COMMON SHARE, UNCHANGED FROM THE PRIOR QUARTER. THE COMMON STOCK CASH DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JULY 3, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JUNE 19, 2023."}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2023-04-20 15:35:00', 'title': 'CAPSTONE PARTNERS REPORTS: INDUSTRIALS M&A REMAINS RESILIENT AMID ECONOMIC AND GEOPOLITICAL UNCERTAINTY', 'text': "BOSTON , APRIL 20, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CAPSTONE PARTNERS, A LEADING MIDDLE MARKET INVESTMENT BANKING FIRM, RELEASED ITS ANNUAL INDUSTRIALS M&A REPORT,\xa0WHICH SHARES INSIGHTS INTO MERGER AND ACQUISITION (M&A) ACTIVITY, PUBLIC MARKET VALUATIONS, THE MACROECONOMIC CLIMATE, AND PROVIDES AN OUTLOOK FOR 2023 INDUSTRY ACTIVITY. WITH EXTENSIVE KNOWLEDGE AND TRANSACTION EXPERIENCE, CAPSTONE'S INDUSTRIALS INVESTMENT BANKING GROUP\xa0PROVIDES UNIQUE COMMENTARY ON SEVEN KEY SECTORS: CHEMICALS & PLASTICS, ENGINEERED PRODUCTS, ENVIRONMENTAL, HEALTH & SAFETY, HVACR, PACKAGING, PRECISION MANUFACTURING, AND WASTE & RECYCLING."}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2023-04-20 07:00:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED REPORTS 2023 FIRST-QUARTER EARNINGS', 'text': "STRONG Q1 RESULTS AND DISCIPLINED EXECUTION DEMONSTRATE HUNTI